writes exactly one JSON file under `results/`; nothing else is a source of numbers.

| Result | Script | Output (`results/`) |
|---|---|---|
| R2 — forecast unseen chemicals | `scripts/run_trajectory_cv.py` | `trajectory_cv.json` |
