## What we do not claim

- **Not human, not clinical.** All training data are rat primary cortical (and hippocampal) cultures.
  Nothing here predicts human developmental outcomes.
- **Not a validated twin of any commercial chip.** The public chip data are undosed rat hippocampal
  sub-networks; compartment-specific dosing scenarios are labelled simulations.
- **Coverage inside the calibration domain only.** Conformal coverage is measured on held-out NFA chemicals
  and is not transferred to other species, cell sources, assays or chips.
- **No superiority claimed over EPA's rules.** With only {{ dnt_r4.json : n_negative }} reference negatives
  the hazard comparison is underpowered; one of three paired tests reaches significance.
- **No model-derived potency.** It lost to interpolation (R3/R3b); potency (BMC) is reported by
  interpolating the measured doses, not by the model.

